{
  "slug": "monorepo-pnpm-turbo",
  "title": null,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "702801e0-19fe-4445-8c1f-1fdc55ad9070",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 0,
      "data": {
        "title": "Por que monorepo"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "32c40965-6d8b-497b-8038-7378504a31bc",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": " Empresas como Google, Meta, Microsoft — todas escolheram monorepo. Motivos: "
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "96d1b287-5e75-4f9a-ba26-9efac2963e99",
          "type": "list",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "items": [
              "Atomic commits: mudança que afeta lib + app viram um commit só, revisado junto.",
              "Shared packages: UI lib, types, configs reusados sem publicar no npm.",
              "CI unificada: build/test de tudo num lugar.",
              "Refatoração cross-projeto: editor enxerga tudo."
            ],
            "ordered": false
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "08e8b3d6-b5ae-44a4-816e-9f9ef61c4b72",
          "type": "callout",
          "position": 2,
          "data": {
            "variant": "info",
            "title": "",
            "content": "Monorepo ≠ gigante arquivo único. Cada package é isolado. O que é compartilhado é o repositório, não o código."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3b7b7e25-34e2-47f7-a0c1-aa55aeeffdc4",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 1,
      "data": {
        "title": "Estrutura típica"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "e625b0e6-8279-4c99-a3a4-4d01d1f28569",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "bash",
            "code": ".\n├── package.json            # raiz, só devDeps\n├── pnpm-workspace.yaml     # define packages/*\n├── turbo.json              # pipeline\n├── tsconfig.base.json      # config shared\n├── packages/\n│   ├── ui/                 # componentes\n│   ├── utils/              # helpers puros\n│   └── types/              # tipos shared\n└── apps/\n    ├── web/                # Next.js\n    └── api/                # backend"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "46a2c1fc-c51f-4558-8fd5-976af3063ecc",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 2,
      "data": {
        "title": "pnpm-workspace.yaml + turbo.json"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "bb89d610-278e-4ad7-ac40-fd7de715d0e2",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "yaml",
            "code": "# pnpm-workspace.yaml\npackages:\n  - 'packages/*'\n  - 'apps/*'"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "12f053ba-dd85-4652-a3fa-8b42556b3809",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "language": "json",
            "code": "{\n  \"pipeline\": {\n    \"build\": {\n      \"dependsOn\": [\"^build\"],\n      \"outputs\": [\"dist/**\", \".next/**\"]\n    },\n    \"test\": {\n      \"dependsOn\": [\"build\"],\n      \"outputs\": []\n    },\n    \"lint\": { \"outputs\": [] },\n    \"dev\": { \"cache\": false, \"persistent\": true }\n  }\n}"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "5fb8ee17-594a-40c9-a7d8-0ec17e4106b4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "position": 2,
          "data": {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "^build",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": " = \"primeiro build dos packages dos quais eu dependo\". "
              },
              {
                "text": "outputs",
                "code": true
              },
              {
                "text": " diz o que cachear. Turbo hasheia inputs; se nada mudou, reusa. "
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "319af1d2-184e-4a4f-9a7b-0dde3391ea7e",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 3,
      "data": {
        "title": "Shared tsconfig"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "59a138a1-2e2f-48fc-a9d5-04b10858ccec",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "json",
            "code": "// tsconfig.base.json (raiz)\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"target\": \"ES2022\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true\n  }\n}\n\n// packages/ui/tsconfig.json\n{\n  \"extends\": \"../../tsconfig.base.json\",\n  \"include\": [\"src/**/*\"]\n}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "90ec7f6c-b2b5-4e0c-a39d-93e5b6cec28d",
      "type": "section",
      "position": 4,
      "data": {
        "title": "Armadilhas reais"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "77dbcd0e-64f3-4eb1-94fd-d1dd11a189b2",
          "type": "list",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "items": [
              "Hoisting sujeito a bug: pnpm é strict. Se seu código importa lib não declarada (veio transiente), quebra. Isso é FEATURE — declare no package.json.",
              "Peer deps entre workspaces: especifique como — pnpm resolve pro package local automaticamente.",
              "CI cold: sem remote cache, builds de monorepo grande ficam lentos. Turbo remote cache (ou self-hosted) resolve.",
              "VSCode perdido: abra o monorepo pela raiz, não por subfolder — senão Intellisense não enxerga packages irmãos."
            ],
            "ordered": false
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}